e through a venture. It requires evidence of customer need and feasible execution.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept logically and relate it to What is Entrepreneurship?; benefits and drawbacks of entreprenrship; Creativity and Risk taking.; Business Reforms. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a specific Entrepreneurship Development task. Identify the objective, method and expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the requirement, mention a limitation or error source, and justify the selection.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning/purpose (2 marks):** Creativity and Risk taking. appears in “Unit 1”. Define its role, explain the main components or steps, connect it to What is Entrepreneurship?, Classification & Characteristics of Entrepreneur, benefits and drawbacks of entreprenrship, Business Reforms, provide a practical example, and note a verification step or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept logically and relate it to What is Entrepreneurship?; Classification & Characteristics of Entrepreneur; benefits and drawbacks of entreprenrship; Business Reforms. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a specific Entrepreneurship Development task. Identify the objective, method and expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the requirement, mention a limitation or error source, and justify the selection.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning/purpose (2 marks):** Business Reforms appears in “Unit 1”. Define its role, explain the main components or steps, connect it to What is Entrepreneurship?, Classification & Characteristics of Entrepreneur, benefits and drawbacks of entreprenrship, Creativity and Risk taking., provide a practical example, and note a verification step or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept logically and relate it to What is Entrepreneurship?; Classification & Characteristics of Entrepreneur; benefits and drawbacks of entreprenrship; Creativity and Risk taking.. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a specific Entrepreneurship Development task. Identify the objective, method and expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the requirement, mention a limitation or error source, and justify the selection.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

