::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning/purpose (2 marks):** Different Image editing tools-Selection tools appears in “Unit 3”. Define its role, explain the main components or steps, connect it to Crop and slice tools, Measuring tools, retouching tool, painting tools, provide a practical example, and note a verification step or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept logically and relate it to Crop and slice tools; Measuring tools; retouching tool; painting tools. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a specific Multimedia and Animation Tools task. Identify the objective, method and expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the requirement, mention a limitation or error source, and justify the selection.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning/purpose (2 marks):** Bitmap/raster images store pixels, so enlarging them beyond their resolution can reveal pixelation. Vector graphics store geometric descriptions and can scale cleanly.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept logically and relate it to Introduction to multimedia; vector graphics; Color channels; Bit depth. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a specific Multimedia and Animation Tools task. Identify the objective, method and expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the requirement, mention a limitation or error source, and justify the selection.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning/purpose (2 marks):** Color channels appears in “Unit 1”. Define its role, explain the main components or steps, connect it to Introduction to multimedia, concept of graphics-bitmap images, vector graphics, Bit depth, provide a practical example, and note a verification step or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept logically and relate it to Introduction to multimedia; concept of graphics-bitmap images; vector graphics; Bit depth. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a specific Multimedia and Animation Tools task. Identify the objective, method and expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the requirement, mention a limitation or error source, and justify the selection.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

